WEBVTT

00:00:00.550 --> 00:00:04.210
Units: each guard, its times, and its director.

00:00:05.060 --> 00:00:12.335
Add each guard. Order is performance order, and the check-in, warm-up and performance times drive the board's alerts.

00:00:12.535 --> 00:00:19.710
Copy director link gives a director a view of their own guard and the one before them, with no phone numbers.

00:00:20.560 --> 00:00:29.890
Edit has the name, class, order, times, and the director. The director's phone and email only show for roles with Director contact.

00:00:30.740 --> 00:00:36.620
A director's link shows their guard and the one before them, live, so they know when they're up.

00:00:37.470 --> 00:00:42.690
The steps the tracker uses, by track: director, guard, props, and together.

00:00:43.540 --> 00:00:46.190
Next: access.
